---
const PHONE_SMS = "sms:+16178675878";
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">Boston &amp; the North Shore</p>
    <h1>The Same Trusted Team Cleans Your Home, Every Time</h1>
    <p class="hero-subhead">
      Reliable, recurring house cleaning across Boston and the North Shore,
      personally handled by Helena and her husband from your first estimate
      to every visit after.
    </p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn btn-primary hero-cta" href="#estimate">
        Get Your Free Estimate
      </a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href={PHONE_SMS}> Text Us — We Reply Fast </a>
    </div>
    <p class="hero-note">
      Quick estimate — just send a photo or video. It's Helena, not a call
      center.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #eaf2f6 0%, var(--color-bg) 100%);
    padding: 3rem 0 2.5rem;
  }

  .hero-inner {
    max-width: 42rem;
  }

  .hero-subhead {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .hero-cta {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .hero-note {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
</style>
